        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Assert abundant availability with 有的是",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "有的是 before an available thing asserts there is plenty. Interpret the expression as a whole, not as separate existence and identity statements.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我有的是时间。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ yǒudeshì shíjiān 。",
                "meaning": "I have plenty of time.",
                "audio": "33d4769535afffd23701612fcdee25670fd139bf830550efb0cf18a316103f44"
              },
              {
                "text": "这里有的是书。",
                "pinyin": "zhèlǐ yǒudeshì shū 。",
                "meaning": "There are plenty of books here.",
                "audio": "1edb69da4b11c85fdadb875d5b7bbde398f1f9f62e725f3e7c0c5899f31e7d22"
